{"words": [{"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "خَلْقِ", "translation": "(the) creation"}, {"text": "ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ", "translation": "(of) the heavens"}, {"text": "وَٱلْأَرْضِ", "translation": "and the earth"}, {"text": "وَٱخْتِلَـٰفِ", "translation": "and alternation"}, {"text": "ٱلَّيْلِ", "translation": "of the night"}, {"text": "وَٱلنَّهَارِ", "translation": "and the day"}, {"text": "وَٱلْفُلْكِ", "translation": "and the ships"}, {"text": "ٱلَّتِى", "translation": "which"}, {"text": "تَجْرِى", "translation": "sail"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَحْرِ", "translation": "the sea"}, {"text": "بِمَا", "translation": "with what"}, {"text": "يَنفَعُ", "translation": "benefits"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسَ", "translation": "[the] people"}, {"text": "وَمَآ", "translation": "and what"}, {"text": "أَنزَلَ", "translation": "(has) sent down"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱلسَّمَآءِ", "translation": "the sky"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "[of]"}, {"text": "مَّآءٍۢ", "translation": "water"}, {"text": "فَأَحْيَا", "translation": "giving life"}, {"text": "بِهِ", "translation": "thereby"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَرْضَ", "translation": "(to) the earth"}, {"text": "بَعْدَ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "مَوْتِهَا", "translation": "its death"}, {"text": "وَبَثَّ", "translation": "and dispersing"}, {"text": "فِيهَا", "translation": "therein"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "[of]"}, {"text": "كُلِّ", "translation": "every"}, {"text": "دَآبَّةٍۢ", "translation": "moving creature"}, {"text": "وَتَصْرِيفِ", "translation": "and directing"}, {"text": "ٱلرِّيَـٰحِ", "translation": "(of) the winds"}, {"text": "وَٱلسَّحَابِ", "translation": "and the clouds"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُسَخَّرِ", "translation": "[the] controlled"}, {"text": "بَيْنَ", "translation": "between"}, {"text": "ٱلسَّمَآءِ", "translation": "the sky"}, {"text": "وَٱلْأَرْضِ", "translation": "and the earth"}, {"text": "لَـَٔايَـٰتٍۢ", "translation": "surely (are) Signs"}, {"text": "لِّقَوْمٍۢ", "translation": "for a people"}, {"text": "يَعْقِلُونَ", "translation": "who use their intellect"}], "sahih": "Indeed, in the creation of the heavens and the earth, and the alternation of the night and the day, and the [great] ships which sail through the sea with that which benefits people, and what Allāh has sent down from the heavens of rain, giving life thereby to the earth after its lifelessness and dispersing therein every [kind of] moving creature, and [His] directing of the winds and the clouds controlled between the heaven and earth are signs for a people who use reason."}